   "date": "2026-11-04",
   "why": "Version 1.5.1. Three defects found after the frozen second-cycle run. (1) FLOW-003: a connection outlived the five-minute DNS entry naming its address and then read as unnamed; the flow check on the fresh captures exposed it, so those captures can no longer test the fix. (2) The relay reset any TCP connection silent for 60 s, found by reading zdtun and confirmed by idle_probe.py; limits now follow RFC 4787 and RFC 5382 and zdtun holds 512 sockets. (3) The owner cache was keyed by local port alone, so a reused port could name the wrong app. Only (1) can change a replay verdict. Frozen hashes and builds stay as recorded.",
